    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17305" root="ريم" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيمٌ</span></b> , (Jm, T, PS,) with kesr, (Jm, PS,) [accord.
to the K, erroneously, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَيْمٌ</span></b> , <i>The antilope leucoryx;</i>] <i>a white antelope;</i> (Jm, PS;) <i>an antelope</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَبْىٌ</span>) <i>that is purely white:</i> (IAar, T, K:)
